      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WAH ELM (1) missed the frame last time when eighth (30.06) at this track in a Mix 6/7 H but not beaten far the start prior. Will find this more suitable and can atone. ASTON WALSH (4) was a last-start winner from the rails at Bendigo over 425m (23.78) after leading through, scoring by 5 lengths. Hard to beat again here. VAPORIZE (5) won comfortably last time scoring by 8 lengths at this track after jumping from box 4 (30.28). Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Leading chance again. YALE DEAN (8) can run a bold race on best form.",
